PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52PZ

   1 a 0000 E52PZ: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006 
   3 a 0006    /* E52PZ (P3-4 FILE-route EXPRESSION item, DIVISION by a */
